      "description": "From the AI job's creation (the backend hands it the photo after the upload) to its result: the time the job waits in the queue plus the analysis itself. The sum of two p95s is an upper estimate. The backend's own upload handling is in 'Backend task time'. Budgets: 4 s target, 10 s NFR-PERF-01 (ADR-0004)."
